# Temporary Staffing Platform

A full-stack web application for temporary staffing, built with React (frontend) and Express + Prisma + SQLite (backend).

## Prerequisites

- Node.js (v18+)
- npm

## Setup & Run Locally

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install

npx prisma migrate dev        # create/apply database migrations
npx prisma generate            # generate Prisma client
npx prisma studio

npm run seed                   # seed the database

npm start                      # starts server on port 3000
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev                    # starts Vite dev server on http://localhost:5173
```

## Cleanup

From the `A3/` directory:

```bash
make clean                     # removes node_modules and lockfiles
```

## Deployment (Railway)

We deployed on Railway (https://railway.app). The backend and frontend are
separate services in the same Railway project.

### Railway Setup

1. Create a new project on Railway.
2. Add two services, each linked to the same GitHub repo but with different
   root directories.

### Backend Service

- **Root directory:** `A3/backend`
- **Build command:**
  ```
  npm install && npx prisma generate && npx prisma migrate deploy && npm run seed
  ```
- **Start command:**
  ```
  npm run start
  ```
- **Environment variables:**
  | Variable       | Value                                              |
  |----------------|----------------------------------------------------|
  | DATABASE_URL   | file:./dev.db                                      |
  | FRONTEND_URL   | https://<frontend-service>.up.railway.app           |

### Frontend Service

- **Root directory:** `A3/frontend`
- **Build command:**
  ```
  npm run build
  ```
- **Start command:**
  ```
  npx serve -s dist
  ```
- **Environment variables:**
  | Variable       | Value                                              |
  |----------------|----------------------------------------------------|
  | VITE_API_URL   | https://<backend-service>.up.railway.app            |


### Our Deployed URLs

- **Frontend:** https://ms-work.up.railway.app
- **Backend:**  https://backend-production-d166.up.railway.app

